# Project Registry

Match the current working directory to the longest repository-path prefix. Paths in this file are authoritative pointers; code is not copied into this workspace.

| Project | Repository path | Memory directory | State |
|---|---|---|---|
| AI Workspace Memory | `/path/to/AI-Workspace` | `projects/ai-workspace` | Active |
| Example Project | `/path/to/my-repo` | `projects/my-repo` | Active |

## Registry rules
- One row per project; do not register individual sessions as projects.
- Use absolute repository paths and workspace-relative memory directories.
- Unregistered directories have no assumed project memory.
